Bids/Purchases
34. Consideration of the recommendation for Laramie County's auditing
services for FY24.
24 - 202
Proposal, CliftonLarsonAllen, LLP
Attachments:
Stanley Walker, County Clerk's Finance Director, explained that it is the county's
practice to issue an RFP every five years for audit services. Walker said the county
received two bids, Haynie & Company and CliftonLarsonAllen, LLP. Walker noted
upon review of the bids that both companies are capable of performing the county's
audit. He said CliftonLarsonAllen's cost was lower. Walker said the audit committee
recommends that CliftonLarsonAllen perform the audit services for the next five years.
A motion was made by Commissioner Thompson, seconded by
Commissioner Holmes, approve the recommendation. The motion carried
by the following vote:
Lovett, Malm, Heath, Holmes, Thompson
Aye:
Land Use:Variances/Board App./Plats
