37. PUBLIC HEARING regarding a zone change from A2 - Agricultural to
MU - Mixed Use for Tract 5, Mesa Tracts, Laramie County, WY.
24 - 225
Green, Zone Change
Attachments:
Bryce Hamilton, Planning, said Inberg-Miller Engineers, on behalf of Trystin and Mike
Green, submitted a zone change application for property in the Mesa Tracts
Subdivision at 8619 US Hwy 30, near the intersection with Dell Range Blvd. He said
the application asks to rezone the property from A2 - Agricultural to MU - Mixed Use,
allowing commercial trailer sales to take place at the property while still being used as
a residence. Hamilton said a site plan will be processed administratively by the
Planning Dept following approval of the zone change.
Hamilton said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval with the
adoption of findings of fact a and b.
Chairman Lovett opened the hearing for PUBLIC COMMENT. Hearing no PUBLIC
COMMENT, Chairman Lovett closed the hearing.
